{"id":129576921,"slug":"asynchronous-office-hours","title":"Asynchronous Office Hours","subtitle":"Announcing a New Feature","post_date":"2023-06-20T11:18:55.304Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/asynchronous-office-hours","wordcount":472,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:58:48.780Z","body_sha256":"d4cf4f95a1879a4fbdd8cc4da1663fe21da83b13af84166cc9ff649fc96c332a","text_words":469,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I was inspired by my collab with <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Leon Macfayden&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:58738258,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6c70f430-a31c-4c10-8271-bdfebdae31a3_708x493.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;de24087e-3949-4e7a-95bb-38731a6ad386&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> in which he emailed me questions and I answered them.  </p><p>Leon writes, from the UK, about what he's lived and learned.   He is a (former) police officer with “lived experience” related to trauma and psychosis.  I’m a huge fan of his writing.  When he wrote an article about terrible therapists, I invited him to ask me any questions he wanted.  And he did. I answered.  It was “fun.” (I have reservations about fun in medicine.  In writing— it is allowed).</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1090\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1090,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2863270,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!hbFF!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fba38df83-9c87-4507-ab85-4fcc04717b36_4032x3019.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This is an exciting use of the <a href=\"https://support.substack.com/hc/en-us/articles/4406178016148-How-can-I-add-a-guest-author-to-a-post-\">substack feature that allows for coauthor-ship.</a>  Thus, I am throwing the floodgates wide open.  Fellow Substack Authors, Email me your questionnaire! </p><p>Then, add me as a Guest Author.  </p><p>And we will see what happens.</p><p>Here is a <a href=\"https://leonmacfayden.substack.com/p/dr-owen-muir-md-responds-to-my-negative\">example from the first collaboration…</a></p><blockquote><p><strong>Q. In my notes, it says I was traumatized by a house fire. I’ve seen people die in every way imaginable EXCEPT a house fire. Surely a&nbsp;therapist’s&nbsp;most important skill is the ability to listen. Why do therapists struggle with this so much?</strong></p><p><em>A: I don't think listening is the most important skill. Because what we hear and what we thought we heard are rarely the same.&nbsp; What we hear in what someone else said and what they think we hear are rarely the same. So I think listening is good, but checking to see if you got it right is better.</em></p><p><em>That would avoid the error in transcription that you refer to above.&nbsp; Therapists are human. And we get things wrong. It's a feature, not a bug.&nbsp; But it needs an additional check:</em></p><p><em>\"I had a problem in a forest fire\"</em></p><p><em>\"so it was a house fire?\"</em></p><p><em>\"no, I said it was a forest fire!\"</em></p><p><em>\"oh my gosh, it seems like I misheard you!&nbsp; What was it like for me to hear that wrong?\"</em></p><p><em>Now we're doing therapy…!</em></p></blockquote><p>I am here for your questions!  They do not need to be relevant to my experience or expertise.  I’ll still do my best.  I’m not saying it’s going to make you famous.  I am saying it a proven traction hack:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg\" width=\"1290\" height=\"1655\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1655,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:597040,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MQTC!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc4bde314-aee9-4be4-bbf8-a1027cd9d61a_1290x1655.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The more absurd, frankly, the better.</p><p>Who's in?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1090\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1090,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2417354,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!HkwB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F83265e27-bf20-4849-9537-9e29d894ebb5_4032x3019.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This may, or may not, be fun.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">The Frontier Psychiatrists is a newsletter with absurd engagement, ride my coattails to fame*  and increased readership!**</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p><em>*these claims have not been evaluated by the FDA.  Please submit questions to this newsletter at your own risk.  </em></p><p><em>**This newsletter is not intended to treat or diagnose any readership related problem or disease.  Side effects may include spelling mistakes, error in judgment, errors in grammar, professional ruin, personal embarrassment, deep feeling of inadequacy, imposter syndrome, becoming an actual imposter, dropsy, narcolepsy, hypoactive readership disorder, and, in rare cases, professional death.   Please ask your readers about other options for improving engagement.</em></p>","text":"I was inspired by my collab with in which he emailed me questions and I answered them.\n\nLeon writes, from the UK, about what he's lived and learned. He is a (former) police officer with “lived experience” related to trauma and psychosis. I’m a huge fan of his writing. When he wrote an article about terrible therapists, I invited him to ask me any questions he wanted. And he did. I answered. It was “fun.” (I have reservations about fun in medicine. In writing— it is allowed).\n\nThis is an exciting use of the substack feature that allows for coauthor-ship. Thus, I am throwing the floodgates wide open. Fellow Substack Authors, Email me your questionnaire!\n\nThen, add me as a Guest Author.\n\nAnd we will see what happens.\n\nHere is a example from the first collaboration…\n\nQ. In my notes, it says I was traumatized by a house fire. I’ve seen people die in every way imaginable EXCEPT a house fire. Surely a therapist’s most important skill is the ability to listen. Why do therapists struggle with this so much?\n\nA: I don't think listening is the most important skill. Because what we hear and what we thought we heard are rarely the same. What we hear in what someone else said and what they think we hear are rarely the same. So I think listening is good, but checking to see if you got it right is better.\n\nThat would avoid the error in transcription that you refer to above. Therapists are human. And we get things wrong. It's a feature, not a bug. But it needs an additional check:\n\n\"I had a problem in a forest fire\"\n\n\"so it was a house fire?\"\n\n\"no, I said it was a forest fire!\"\n\n\"oh my gosh, it seems like I misheard you! What was it like for me to hear that wrong?\"\n\nNow we're doing therapy…!\n\nI am here for your questions! They do not need to be relevant to my experience or expertise. I’ll still do my best. I’m not saying it’s going to make you famous. I am saying it a proven traction hack:\n\nThe more absurd, frankly, the better.\n\nWho's in?\n\nThis may, or may not, be fun.\n\nThe Frontier Psychiatrists is a newsletter with absurd engagement, ride my coattails to fame* and increased readership!**\n\n*these claims have not been evaluated by the FDA. Please submit questions to this newsletter at your own risk.\n\n**This newsletter is not intended to treat or diagnose any readership related problem or disease. Side effects may include spelling mistakes, error in judgment, errors in grammar, professional ruin, personal embarrassment, deep feeling of inadequacy, imposter syndrome, becoming an actual imposter, dropsy, narcolepsy, hypoactive readership disorder, and, in rare cases, professional death. Please ask your readers about other options for improving engagement."}